/P 151 0 R
/E (To commemorate the 100th anniversary of Nalanda College, the Nalanda College Science Society is thrilled to announce the launch of a monthly e-magazine dedicated to the wonders of science. This publication will explore cutting-edge research, spotlight pioneering discoveries, and share insights from the vibrant scientific community. Our goal is to ignite curiosity, inspire innovation, and keep readers informed on the latest advancements across various scientific disciplines. Join us as we celebrate a century of academic excellence with a publication designed to educate, engage, and excite readers of all backgrounds.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
