/E (The Science Society of Nalanda College, with a proud history of 70 years, has always sought to innovate and inspire. In continuation of this tradition, launched an e-magazine called "Pulse Quest" in November 2024, conceptualized by the creative vision of students of the Science Society.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
