/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E ( Under the proud 70 year legacy of the Nalanda College Science Society, Pulse Quest grew from a simple vision into a nationwide platform uniting students who share a love for science. Through the collective dedication of our Founding Pulse Quest Team, we successfully completed 10 issues of Volume 1 and 5 issues of Volume 2, creating opportunities for young minds across Sri Lanka to share knowledge, ideas, and creativity.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (A special word of gratitude goes to our Pulse Quest Team for your commitment, teamwork, and belief in this journey, which transformed a vision into a lasting reality. I also extend my sincere appreciation to the Computer, Robotics, Bio Science, Mathematics, and Aeronautical societies for joining hands with us and contributing towards making Volume 2 an extraordinary and impactful chapter of Pulse Quest. Your support, collaboration, and enthusiasm greatly strengthened this initiative and reflected the true spirit of scientific unity and innovation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (I extend my sincere thanks to the Nalanda College Science Society, our teachers, supporters, contributors, and every reader who stood with us throughout this journey. As I conclude this chapter, I do so with immense gratitude, unforgettable memories, and great pride in what we achieved together. May Pulse Quest continue to inspire, evolve, and reach even greater heights in the years to come. In the future, Pulse Quest will return with even more innovative experiences and fresh dimensions, and I extend my heartfelt best wishes to the new team as they carry this legacy forward in a way that best suits its vision and spirit.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
