352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (Forget dusty textbooks and static models. The "Bio Tech revolution", driven by the transformative power of genetic engineering is not merely reshaping life it's actually becoming part of the warp & weft of our future, threads of ingenuity weaving their way through medicine farming & even our understanding of what it means to be human This is not evolution, this is not creeping forward gradually - this is shining, speeding, intermingling of technology & life, promising Solutions to some of humankind's most intractable knotty problems while presenting us with fundamental ethical dilemmas.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
