/P 165 0 R
/E (The traditional approach to medicine which seeks to cure symptoms whenever they arise, is being revolutionized by genetic engineering's precision. A new era of preventative, personalized health is dawning, in which our personal genetic code is a blue-print for health.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
357 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 771 0 R
/E (The CRISPR Precision Strike for Eradicating disease : )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Imagine having a molecular scalpel that will eliminate faulty genes causing genetic disease passed along through heredity. Game-changing gene - edited technology, CRISPR-Cas9, is making that possible From targeting cystic fibrosis & Huntington's disease at their roots to building new treatments for Sickle cell anemia & muscular dystrophy, CRISPR IS offering a future when genetic predisposition does not control fate anymore. This isn't treatment for Symptoms, this is actually eliminating disease at its root by rewriting genetic code)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 772 0 R
/E (The Body's New allies Engineered Immunotherapy:)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Immunotherapy is pioneering a new age in cancer therapy. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Genetic Engineering holds out hope for turbo charging our own immune cells in order for them to spot & destroy cancer. CAR T-cell therapy is a case in point, genetically modifying a patient's T-cells to generate chimeric antigen receptors \(CARS\) specifically for targeting cancer cells alone. This customized treatment, leveraging the body 's own immune system is making history in treating previously untreatable cancers.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
