367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (Genetically altered organisms from bacteria to mammalian cells are being turned into high-tech bio-factories for producing complex therapeutic proteins known as Biologics. Diabetes medicines such as Insulin, Monoclonal antibodies for autoimmune disease & cancer, and an expanding list of next generation drugs all are products of this bio-manufacturing era. Scientists already are exploring methods for making "living medicines - genetically engineered bacteria that can inhabit living tissue & deliver therapeutic payloads directly into diseased tissue.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
368 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 775 0 R
/E (The potential for our Genes to Predict: )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (Prevention for all people: Our genetic code itself contains great amounts of information about our predisposition toward numerous diseases. The genetic age is pushing forward development of the new diagnostic technology that will be capable of recognizing these predispositions early, which will allow us to take preventative measures based upon our own genetic code. This personalized prevention pathway has potential for changing healthcare provision from a reactive system into a preventative system.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
