375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (With our world grappling with the worsening impacts of climate change, genetic engineering is one of the most effective ways of producing crops that are tolerant to heat, drought & high salinity. Having heat tolerance & drought tolerance engineered into crops IS crucial in addressing food security for today's fast-changing world. This goes beyond yield enhancement; it's about adding resilience into our food system.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 778 0 R
/E (Nutritional Fortification: )
