/K [6]
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (Bioengineering a Healthier Diet: Malnutrition, & in particular malnutrition in developing countries, is one of the leading global health priorities. With genetic engineering, we can fortify staple foods with improved nutrition. "Golden Rice", genetically engineered for beta-carotene Can antecedent to Vitamin A\), offers a wonderful example of how bio-engineering can be put into practice in order to counteract deficiencies in vitamins. Scientists are currently seeking to enhance levels of essential amino acids, iron & other essential nutrients in foods widely consumed.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
