379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E ( Engineering for a Greener World: Principles in genetics are applied in order to push innovations toward cleaner industrial processes. Micro-organisms can be genetically engineered for maximum production from renewable resources into biofuels, offering cleaner alternatives compared to fossil fuel use. Similarly, scientists are genetically engineering microbes for plastic waste degradation & the production of biodegradable commodities for reducing growing plastic pollution concerns. This "Bio-economy" holds tremendous potential for reducing our footprint in the environment.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
