/Title (Similarly, fingerprint analysis long considered foolproof relies heavily on human judgment rather than pure mathematics. It is not just algorithms matching exact patterns; it involves human analysts who are naturally susceptible to "cognitive bias." If an analyst is informed that a suspect has a highly violent history, their brain may subconsciously force a pattern match where none actually exists.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 517 0 R
/Prev 810 0 R
/Next 1156 0 R
>>
endobj
1019 0 obj
<<
/Title (Furthermore, as we crash into the era of deepfakes and AI-generated realities, digital forensics faces an unprecedented crisis. When a video, an audio recording, or a digital photograph can be perfectly fabricated to frame an innocent party, what truly constitutes "hard evidence" anymore? The justice system is struggling to keep pace with technology that can seamlessly manipulate reality.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 517 0 R
/Prev 1156 0 R
/Next 811 0 R
>>
endobj
